# complementary notes for focus.schema.tomllmd
# These are NOT part of the auto-generated schema — they supplement it.
# The schema itself is generated from FocusSchema in datum_schema.rs.

# ── Spec provenance ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Canonical: https://focus.finops.org/focus-specification/v1-3/
# Columns:   https://focus.finops.org/focus-columns/
