#              Mike Fuller (FinOps Foundation)

# ── krateo mapping ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# krateoplatformops/finops-operator-focus maps the same FOCUS columns as a K8s CRD.
# b00t uses the same column model without K8s — datums are the schema layer.
# The FocusConfig CRD spec.focusSpec maps 1:1 to these headers.

# ── VFS future design ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Candidate crates (all on crates.io):
#   fuse-backend-rs = "0.14"  — production FUSE server + virtio-fs
#   io-uring = "0.7"          — kernel-bypass async I/O for sandbox page faults
#   memfs = "0.1"             — in-memory filesystem structure
#   bare-vfs = "0.3"          — no_std virtual filesystem for WASM sandboxes
# Design: SkillStorage trait (DiskStorage | MemStorage | FuseStorage | RemoteStorage)
# FuseStorage would mount t00n-serialized records as POSIX files via fuse-backend-rs.
# io_uring variant: share page-cache between b00t-mcp and sandbox via registered buffers.
